      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "src/hooks/\n\n- useDrivers\n   what this does is it\nhandles the state of \nwhat is fetched from the\nbackend.\n    - is it loading?\n    - is there an error?\n    - is the data updated?\n    - do I need to fetch\n    again?\n    - data from the \n    backend",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "src/hooks/\n\n- useDrivers\n   what this does is it\nhandles the state of \nwhat is fetched from the\nbackend.\n    - is it loading?\n    - is there an error?\n    - is the data updated?\n    - do I need to fetch\n    again?\n    - data from the \n    backend",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
