      "updated": 1789743967883,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Normal components.\n\ndisplay something to the \nuser. but you want to show\ndifferent depening on\nsomething happening.\n\n- is it loading? \n    - show a spinner/loading\n    skeleton.\n- is it an error?\n    - display error.\n- is it loaded and ready?\n    - display the info.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Normal components.\n\ndisplay something to the \nuser. but you want to show\ndifferent depening on\nsomething happening.\n\n- is it loading? \n    - show a spinner/loading\n    skeleton.\n- is it an error?\n    - display error.\n- is it loaded and ready?\n    - display the info.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
